        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), var(--hover-color)); padding: 2rem; text-align: center; color: white; border-radius: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0;">
                    <i class="fas fa-child" style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"></i>
                    <h5>Kids Wear</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Soft and safe organic cotton apparel for children of all ages.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), var(--hover-color)); padding: 2rem; text-align: center; color: white; border-radius: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0;">
                    <i class="fas fa-list" style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"></i>
                    <h5>Specialized Collections</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Polos, hoodies, sweatshirts, oversized fits, and custom printed apparel.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), var(--hover-color)); padding: 2rem; text-align: center; color: white; border-radius: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0;">
                    <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart" style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"></i>
                    <h5>Bulk Support</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Dedicated support for large orders with consistent quality and timely delivery.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-color), var(--hover-color)); padding: 2rem; text-align: center; color: white; border-radius: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0;">
                    <i class="fas fa-palette" style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"></i>
                    <h5>Customization</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <p>Custom design options and bulk printing for branded apparel.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

